<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full mt-0.5 border border-green-200 dark:border-green-800/50">IN PROGRESS</span>
</div>
<button class="p-2 -mr-2 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
